---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Fesq is an independent applied research group."
>
  <section class="py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="max-w-[68ch]">
        <Eyebrow text="About" />
        <h1 class="font-display text-5xl mt-6">A group, by design.</h1>

        <div class="prose-article mt-10">
          <p>Fesq is an independent applied research group. We take on work where engineering depth matters more than visibility — intelligent systems, payment infrastructure, cloud platforms.</p>
          <p>We do not publish a roster. We do not run keynotes. What we do publish is what we build, and what we learn building it.</p>
          <p>The people behind Fesq have spent decades inside production systems that move real money and serve real traffic. That experience is available — quietly.</p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="inline-block mt-10 border border-champagne/60 text-champagne px-6 py-3 text-sm tracking-wide hover:border-champagne transition-colors"
        >
          Start a conversation →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
